OL,3,A'I'm 96 and have 15 million followers':
OL,4,AThe grannies taking over TikTok
OL,5,
OL,6,FNinety-six-year-old Lillian Droniak,
OL,7,Fknown as Grandma Droniak to her social
OL,8,Fmedia followers, went viral in June
OL,9,Fafter claiming her retirement home had
OL,10,Fthreatened to evict her for throwing
OL,11,Fparties.
OL,13,FThe home later confirmed the threat,
OL,14,Fbut reached a settlement with Droniak
OL,15,Fthat allowed her to keep partying ` but
OL,16,Fnot supply alcoholic drinks.
OL,18,FWith 15 million followers, Droniak has
OL,19,Fturned her personality into a lucrative
OL,20,Fbusiness, earning enough from social
OL,21,Fmedia to cover her nursing home fees of
OL,22,F$12,000 (#9,000) a month.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
