OL,3,A'I'm 96 and have 15 million followers':
OL,4,AThe grannies taking over TikTok
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Connecticut grandma is one of many
OL,7,Folder women finding unexpected fame
OL,8,Fonline, with most of their audiences
OL,9,Foften young enough to be their
OL,10,Fgrandchildren.
